{"ID":"20240205153630-3ytoy5t","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153630-3ytoy5t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153630-3ytoy5t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111815-f4yvn9j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164654-tt97ief\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111815-f4yvn9j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:346,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:346\u0026#125;","title":"珍珠母","type":"doc","updated":"20240902105254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206111815-f4yvn9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111815-f4yvn9j","updated":"20240206111822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于安徽、江苏、河北、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t三角帆蚌：略呈不等边四角形。壳面生长轮呈同心环状排列。后背缘向上突起，形成大的三角形帆状后翼。内面外套痕明显；前闭壳肌痕呈卵圆形、后闭壳肌痕略呈三角形。左右壳均具两枚拟主齿，左壳具两枚长条侧齿，右壳具一枚长条形侧齿；具光泽。质坚硬。气微腥，味淡。\n褶纹冠蚌：呈不等边三角形。后背缘向上伸展成大形的冠。壳内面外套痕略明显；前闭壳肌痕大呈楔形，后壳肌痕呈不规则卵圆形，在后侧齿下方有与壳面相应的纵肋和凹沟。左、右壳均具一枚短而略粗后侧齿及一细弱的前侧齿，均无拟主齿。\n马氏珍珠贝：呈斜四方形，后耳大，前耳小，背缘平直，腹缘圆，生长线极细密，成片状。闭壳肌痕大，长形，具一凸起的长形主齿。平滑。质脆，折断时成粉屑或小片状，半透明。臭微，味淡。\n【性味】\t咸，寒。\n【功效】\t平肝潜阳，定惊明目。用于头痛眩晕，烦躁失眠，肝热目赤，肝虚目昏。\n【注解】\t“珠光”：指珍珠母表面光滑，呈半透明状，具浅粉红色及其他特有的彩色光泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111813-x5671ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111813-x5671ln","updated":"20240206111813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206111813-ncguddg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164654-tt97ief","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164654-tt97ief","updated":"20240717110414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 651px;","style":"width: 641px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"珍珠母"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/珍珠母-20240205164654-s4nfhky.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 641px;\" parent-style=\"width: 651px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717105438-sw2o413","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717105438-sw2o413","updated":"20240717105528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三角帆蚌"}]},{"ID":"20240717105643-nil8kaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717105643-nil8kaz","updated":"20240717105737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三角帆蚌 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三角帆蚌 1-20240717105643-1nwgmkg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 448px;","style":"width: 438px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三角帆蚌 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三角帆蚌 2-20240717105722-037onuj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 438px;\" parent-style=\"width: 448px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 335px;","style":"width: 325px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三角帆蚌"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三角帆蚌-20240717105647-bfiiymm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 325px;\" parent-style=\"width: 335px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717105438-p8z0ho5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717105438-p8z0ho5","updated":"20240717110019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"褶纹冠蚌（鸡冠蚌）"}]},{"ID":"20240717105835-v3um7hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717105835-v3um7hc","updated":"20240717110044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"褶纹冠蚌"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/褶纹冠蚌-20240717105835-qoeajq4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 338px;","style":"width: 328px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"褶纹冠蚌 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/褶纹冠蚌 2-20240717110033-16z93rn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 328px;\" parent-style=\"width: 338px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"褶纹冠蚌 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/褶纹冠蚌 1-20240717105853-uhh5tr6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717105541-lc1a22q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717105541-lc1a22q","updated":"20240717105542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"马氏珍珠贝"}]},{"ID":"20240717110208-p5lj0aj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717110208-p5lj0aj","updated":"20240717110401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马氏珍珠贝 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马氏珍珠贝 1-20240717110208-nnlg7qd.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马氏珍珠贝 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马氏珍珠贝 2-20240717110305-xp0jzam.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 331px;","style":"width: 321px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"马氏珍珠贝 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/马氏珍珠贝 3-20240717110356-aogx694.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 321px;\" parent-style=\"width: 331px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717105438-5wf1so4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717105438-5wf1so4","updated":"20240717105453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为蚌科动物三角帆蚌、褶纹冠蚌或珍珠贝科动物马氏珍珠贝的贝壳。"}]},{"ID":"20240717105439-f0svrak","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717105439-f0svrak"}},{"ID":"20240902105252-pdsopa9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-pdsopa9","updated":"20240902105254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中草药：珍珠母"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-flcgb9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-flcgb9p","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"珍珠母《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-vwlmnhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-vwlmnhr","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhēnZhūMǔ"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-z3776ub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-z3776ub","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CONCHAMARGARITIFERA"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-ximozoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-ximozoj","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】真珠母、明珠母"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-p7evvba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-p7evvba","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为蚌科动物三角帆蚌Hyriopsiscumingii（Lea）、褶纹冠蚌Cristariaplicata（Leach）或珍珠贝科动物马氏珍珠贝Pteriamartensii（Dunker）的贝壳。去肉，洗净，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-lb6qiwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-lb6qiwn","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-u9tkrc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-u9tkrc6","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三角帆蚌：略呈不等边四角形。壳面生长轮呈同心环状排列。后背缘向上突起，形成大的三角形帆状后翼。壳内面外套痕明显；前闭壳肌痕呈卵圆形、后闭壳肌痕略呈三角形。左右壳均具两枚拟主齿，左壳具两枚长条形侧齿，右壳具一枚长条形侧齿；具光泽。质坚硬。气微腥，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-nerql13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-nerql13","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"褶纹冠蚌：呈不等边三角形。后背缘向上伸展成大形的冠。壳内面外套痕略明显；前闭壳肌痕大呈楔形，后闭壳肌痕呈不规则卵圆形，在后侧齿下方有与壳面相应的纵肋和凹沟。左、右壳均具一枚短而略粗后侧齿及一枚细弱的前侧齿，均无拟主齿。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-uzn8fnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-uzn8fnb","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"马氏珍珠贝：呈斜四方形，后耳大，前耳小，背缘平直，腹缘圆，生长线极细密，成片状。闭壳肌痕大，长圆形，具一凸起的长形主齿。平滑。质脆，折断时成粉屑或小片状，半透明。臭微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-rx05s8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-rx05s8y","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-92did5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-92did5f","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品粉末类白色。不规则碎块，表面多不平整，呈明显的颗粒性，有的呈层状结构，边缘多数为不规则锯齿状。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-9f58aps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-9f58aps","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末，加稀盐酸，即发生大量气泡，滤过，滤液显钙盐的鉴别反应（附录Ⅳ）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-d1wq7o8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-d1wq7o8","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-fzgmq1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-fzgmq1u","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"珍珠母：除去杂质，打碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-07glinq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-07glinq","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煅珍珠母：取净珍珠母，照明煅法（附录ⅡD）煅至酥脆。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-uy0v76s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-uy0v76s","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-dz5768v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-dz5768v","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、心经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-v7w5d79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-v7w5d79","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】平肝潜阳，定惊明目。用于头痛眩晕，烦躁失眠，肝热目赤，肝虚目昏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-w6gn6y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-w6gn6y6","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】10～25g，先煎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-stlqmdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-stlqmdj","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处，防尘。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-btast4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-btast4r","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-7xb3e9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-7xb3e9e","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"珍珠母《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-eqdwuo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-eqdwuo8","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《饮片新参》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-9s9oigg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-9s9oigg","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhēnZhūMǔ"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-9p2gsud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-9p2gsud","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】珠牡、珠母（《本草图经》），明珠母（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-xp7z5m8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-xp7z5m8","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为珍珠贝科动物珍珠贝、马氏珠珠贝或蚌科动物几种河蚌贝壳的珍珠层。全年均可收集。将贝壳用碱水煮过，漂净，刮去外层黑皮，煅至松脆即成。市售品有采自制钮扣剩下的废蚌壳加工而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-efgekva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-efgekva","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】动物形态详\"珍珠\"、\"蚌肉\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-jqnd3p4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-jqnd3p4","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】主产江苏、浙江、湖北、安徽等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-4wuly9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-4wuly9i","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】为不规则的片状，大小不一，厚约5毫米。一面浅粉红色，有彩色光泽，一面乳白色，平滑，有光泽；表面有白粉。质松脆，可层层剥离。气无，味淡。以片大、色白、酥松而不碎者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-gh9yt50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-gh9yt50","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】射线裂脊蚌的贝壳中，含碳酸钙90％以上，有机质约0.34％；尚含少量镁、铁、硅酸盐、硫酸盐、磷酸盐和氯化物。煅烧后，碳酸盐分解，产生氧化钙等，有机质则被破坏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-n0poivh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-n0poivh","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-i4kq9hv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-i4kq9hv","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以马氏珍珠贝的珍珠层粉末给家兔后，血中钙离子浓度，与给碳酸钙后几无差别。其30％硫酸水解产物，含有:白氨酸、蛋氨酸、丙氨酸、甘氨酸、谷氨酸、天门冬氨酸等氨基酸，对兔的耳壳血管及血压无作用，但能增大离体蟾蜍心跳振幅，降低离体兔肠张力，对兔有短暂的利尿作用。珍珠层4N盐酸提取液能抑制组织胺对离体豚鼠小肠的收缩作用。其乙醚提取液能抑制组织胺对肠管的收缩，防止组织胺引起豚鼠的休克及死亡；对马血清致敏的豚鼠过敏性休克虽不能防止，但对脏器过敏，如对豚鼠离体肠管、子宫的收缩，则有抑制的倾向。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-tb8y9bn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-tb8y9bn","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"珍珠贝壳粉对小鼠肉瘤-180有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-qjvafc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-qjvafc6","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，敲成碎块，筛去灰屑。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-qbsoxmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-qbsoxmy","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-iduvb4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-iduvb4w","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-u6dn0k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-u6dn0k8","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《中国医学大辞典》:\"甘咸，冷，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-29if1un","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-29if1un","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《饮片新参》:\"咸平，凉，微腥。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-pbm8bw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-pbm8bw5","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】《中国医学大辞典》:\"入心、肝两经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-fxgrobu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-fxgrobu","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-qk1v66t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-qk1v66t","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平肝，潜阳，定惊，止血。治头眩，耳鸣，心悸，失眠，癫狂，惊痫，吐血，衄血，妇女血崩。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-y7dn2c3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-y7dn2c3","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《中国医学大辞典》:\"滋肝阴，清肝火。治癫狂惊痫，头眩，耳鸣，心跳，胸腹腆胀，妇女血热，血崩，小儿惊搐发痉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-qv8qyp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-qv8qyp3","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《饮片新参》:\"平肝潜阳，安神魂，定惊痫，消热痞、眼翳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-sadvjd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-sadvjd6","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《吉林中草药》:\"止血。治吐血，衄血，崩漏。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-zr200e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-zr200e8","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服:煎汤，0.3～1两:或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-hhybqvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-hhybqvj","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】胃寒者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-eouwr4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-eouwr4p","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-fkn7qus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-fkn7qus","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治肝阳上升，头晕头痛，眼花耳呜，面颊燥热:珍珠母五钱至一两，制女贞、旱莲草各三钱。水煎服。（《常用中草药图谱》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-kphyb1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-kphyb1l","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治心悸失眠:珍珠母五钱至一两，远志一钱，酸枣仁三钱，炙甘草一钱五分。水煎服。（《常用中草药图谱》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-2w8vmxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-2w8vmxw","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治内眼疾患（晶体混浊，视神经萎缩）:珍珠母二两，苍术八钱，人参一钱。水煎，日服二次。（《吉林中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-1ugbjzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-1ugbjzi","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】《中国医学大辞典》:\"此物（珍珠母）兼入心、肝两经，与石决明但入肝经者不同，故涉神志病者，非此不可。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-t7cb90n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-t7cb90n","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-4wn331e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-4wn331e","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"珍珠母《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-9sbqcja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-9sbqcja","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《饮片新参》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-erzcudz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-erzcudz","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ZhēnZhūMǔ"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-t6c5fal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-t6c5fal","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Nacre，Mother-of-pearl"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-atw0r97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-atw0r97","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】珠牡、珠母、真珠母、明珠母"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-yv79tga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-yv79tga","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-ondrtd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-ondrtd2","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为蚌科动物褐纹冠蚌、三角帆蚌或珍珠贝科动物合浦珠母贝的贝壳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-w90etyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-w90etyi","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Cristariaplicata(Leach)Hyriopsiscumingii(Lea)Pteriamartensii(Ounker)"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-2yk0ml9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-2yk0ml9","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采收。捞取贝壳后，除去肉质、泥土，洗净，放入碱水中煮，然后放入淡水中浸洗，取出，刮去外层黑皮，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-a384pcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-a384pcf","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-jihlq7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-jihlq7n","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.合渍珠母贝，贝壳为斜四方形，壳质较脆，壳长50-90mm，宽18-32mm，高与长相近，较大个体高可达100mm以上。壳顶位于前方，两侧有耳，前耳较后耳稍小。两壳不等，右壳较平，左壳稍凸，右壳前耳下方有一明显的足丝凹陷。背缘平直；腹缘圆，壳面淡黄褐色，同心生长轮脉极细密，成片状，薄脆易脱落，壳中部常呈磨损状近腹缘的排列紧密，延伸成小舌末端稍翘起，足丝孔大，足丝呈毛发状。壳内面中部珍珠层厚而发达，具极强的珍珠光泽。有的外套膜受刺激后，上皮组织急剧裂殖，形成珍珠囊，且不断分泌珍珠质，才逐渐形成珍珠。壳内面边缘淡黄色，无珍珠层。铰合线直，有一突起主齿，沿铰合线下方有一长齿片。韧带紫褐色，前上掣肌痕明显，位于壳顶下方，闭壳肌痕大，长圆形，前端稍尖，位于壳中央稍近后方。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-9vrppys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-9vrppys","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.珠母贝，贝壳呈不规则圆形，壳质坚厚，一般壳长110-150mm，大者可达200mm左右，高与长近等，左壳稍凸略大于右壳，壳顶位于背缘前端并向前弯，右壳顶前方有一凹陷，为足丝出孔，两壳耳不明显，壳表面棕褐色或绿褐色，壳顶光滑，暗绿色，其余部分被有同心形鳞片，鳞片延伸至壳的边缘呈棘状或锯齿状，中部鳞片常脱落，多数留有淡白色放射状。壳内面珍珠层厚，有虹彩光泽，铰合线直，无齿，韧带强壮，紫褐色，前上掣肌痕较小，闭壳肌痕宽大，长圆形，略呈葫芦状，外套缘黑色，肛门膜具黑色素，肥厚宽大，顶端有一小突起。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-qw6bvno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-qw6bvno","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.大珠母贝，贝壳近五边形，略圆，壳质坚实厚重，成体壳长超过200mm，大者可达300mm以上，重大4-5kg，是珍珠贝中最大的一种，壳稍平，壳顶位于背缘前端，前耳小，无后耳。壳表面鳞片排列不规则，呈灰黄褐色，放射肋淡褐色，老贝壳体鳞片常脱落，显露珍珠层，放射肋不明显。壳内面具很厚的银白色珍珠层，边缘部黄褐色。铰合部后端稍突出。韧带宽厚，脱落后有一凹痕。闭壳肌痕宽大，的肾形，痕面不平滑，有许多横纹。肛门膜舌形，末端宽圆。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-n2wojtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-n2wojtf","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.长耳珠母贝，贝壳近方形，壳长100mm左右，个体比合浦珠母稍大，壳顶位于前方，无前耳，后耳较长，成翼状突起，右壳较平，左壳稍凸。壳表边缘鳞片层薄，成片翘起。壳内面具银白色珍珠层，闭壳肌痕细长。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-i9eefsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-i9eefsh","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.三角帆蚌，贝壳大而扁平，壳质坚硬，外形略呈三角形。左右两壳顶紧接在一起，后背缘长，并向上突起形成大的三角形帆状后翼，前背缘短小，呈尖角状。腹缘近直线，略呈弧形。壳面不平滑，壳顶部刻有粗大的肋脉。生长线同心环状排列，距离宽。贝壳内面平滑，珍珠层乳白色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-o24vna6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-o24vna6","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.褶纹冠蚌，贝壳较大，略呈不等边三角形。前背缘冠突不明显，后部长高，后背缘向上斜出伸展成为大形的冠。壳的后背部自过错顶起向后有一系列的逐渐粗大的纵肋。腹级长近直线。壳面深黄绿色至黑褐色，壳顶常受侵蚀而丢失表层颜色。珍珠层有光泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-rs47tfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-rs47tfv","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.背角无齿蚌，贝壳外形呈有角突的卵圆形，前端稍圆，后端呈斜切状，腹缘呈弧形。后背部有自壳顶射出的三条粗肋脉。壳面绿褐色。闭壳肌痕长椭圆形。壳内面珍珠层乳白色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-ssk2klh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-ssk2klh","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-inz3lui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-inz3lui","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.栖息于风浪较平静的海湾中，泥沙、岩礁或砾较多的海底，以足丝固着生活于岩礁或石块上，以潮流通畅、水质较肥的海区生长较好。从低潮线附近至水深10m左右均有生长，通常在5m的深处较多。以硅藻为主食，适且生长温度在15-30℃之间，产卵期5-10月，生长速度较快，一般2年壳高即可达70mm左右。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-7rmvpyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-7rmvpyo","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.栖息于潮间带低潮线附近，以足丝固着于岩礁缝际或珊瑚礁内，且多固着于背风浪的岩石基部。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-zh5ho0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-zh5ho0d","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.多栖息于水深20m左右的海区，在60m的深处也能采到。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-mw6q6cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-mw6q6cs","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.生境和分布同合浦珠母贝。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-0vlnkf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-0vlnkf7","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.生活于淡水泥底稍带沙质的河湖中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-hxyk7c0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-hxyk7c0","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.生活于江河、湖泊的泥底，行动迟缓。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-v9u02u7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-v9u02u7","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.生活于江河湖沼泥底。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-c5s1vwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-c5s1vwx","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于广东、广西沿海，尤以北部湾较为常见，广西合浦产量最高。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-c4ynv6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-c4ynv6e","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于广东、海南、广西及西沙群岛等沿海为育珠的良种之一。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-1okthk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-1okthk3","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.分布于海南及西沙群岛为热带亚热带种。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-b1gmg82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-b1gmg82","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.生境与分布同合浦珠母贝。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-lo6lgv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-lo6lgv7","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.分布于河北、江苏、安徽、浙江等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-9quunrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-9quunrd","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.分布于全国各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-8uqg7qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-8uqg7qh","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.分布于全国各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-5ykgtvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-5ykgtvn","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-s4lq1k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-s4lq1k8","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别（1）三角帆蚌，完整的贝壳，略呈不等边四角形。壳面生长轮呈同心环状排列。后背缘向上突起，形成大的三角形帆状后翼。壳内面外套痕明显：前闭壳肌痕呈卵圆形，后闭壳肌痕略呈三角形。左、右壳均具2枚拟主齿，左壳具2枚长条形侧齿，右壳具1枚长条形侧齿；具光泽。质坚硬，气微腥，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-ez3nq03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-ez3nq03","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）褐纹冠蚌，完整的贝壳呈不等边三角形，后背缘向上伸展成大形的冠。壳内面外套痕略明显；前闭壳肌痕大，呈楔形，后闭壳肌痕呈不规则卵圆形，在后侧齿下方有与壳面相应的纵肋和凹沟。左、右壳均具1枚短而略粗的后侧齿及1枚细弱的前侧齿，均无拟主齿。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-nczerno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-nczerno","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）合浦珠母贝，完整的贝壳呈斜四方形，后耳大，前耳小，背缘平直，腹缘圆，生长线极细密，成片状。闭壳肌痕大，长圆形，具一突起的长形主齿。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-epmijm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-epmijm6","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别粉末特征：灰白色。①珍珠层较大碎块灰白色、灰黄色或淡黄棕色，小碎块近无色。表面多不平整，呈明显的颗粒性，有的块片呈片层结构而较松散，易断裂，边缘具不规则锯齿状，小碎片几为单片。②棱柱层碎块少见，淡黄或灰黄色，断面呈棱柱状，断端大多平截，有的一端渐尖，有明显的横向条纹，少数条纹不明显；顶面观偶见，呈多角形或类方形。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-frsw03r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-frsw03r","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-m2hqzvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-m2hqzvk","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.合浦珠母贝，贝壳主含碳酸钙92%以上，有机物5%，其中以角壳蛋白为主，尚含铝、铜=、铁、镁、钠、锌、磷、钡、硫、氯、钾、硅等多种无机元素。贝壳珍珠层粉含氨基氮0.35%，其贝壳硬蛋白（conchiolin）由苏氨酸（threonine），甘氨酸（glycine），脯氨酸（proline）天冬氨酸（asparticacid），谷氨酸（glutamicacid），丙氨酸（alanine），丝氨酸（serine），精氨酸（arginine），亮氨酸（leucine），缬氨酸（valine），酷氨酸（ttyrosine），苯丙氨酸（phenylalanine）异亮氨酸（isoleucine），赖氨酸（lysine），组氨酸（histidine），蛋氨酸（methionine），胱氨酸（cystine）等17种氨基酸组成，还含有三种非蛋白质水解产物氨基酸：牛磺酸（taurine），鸟氨酸（ornithine），丝氨酸磷酸酯（serinephosphate）。珍珠层粉中的无机元素有钙、钠、钾、镁、硅种。贝壳棱柱（prismjaticlayer）层含氨基酸以甘氨酸、亮氨酸、丝氨酸、组氨酸为主。珠母层含氨基酸以现氨酸、甘氨酸、缬氨酸、天冬氨酸为主。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-oxokjdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-oxokjdw","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又含磷酸乙醇胺（phosphorylethanolamine），并含半乳糖基神经酰胺。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-l8zt64a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-l8zt64a","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.珠母贝，珠母层主要成分为贝壳硬蛋白和碳酸钙的含量在92%左右，有机物占5%左右，含铝、铜、铁、镁、锰、钠、锌、硅、钛等金属元素，含组氨酸、精氨酸、苏氨酸、丝氨酸、谷氨酸、甘氨酸、丙氨酸、缬氨酸、亮氨酸、胱氨酸、酷氨酸、天冬氨酸、苯丙氨酸、蛋氨酸等14种氨基酸；棱柱层（prismatic-calaitelayer）水解液中含丝氨酸和甘氨酸等；珍珠层含贝壳硬蛋白和其他蛋白质，另含卟啉（porphyrin）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-xihvq7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-xihvq7j","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】以马氏珍珠贝的珍珠层粉末给家兔后，血中钙离子浓度，与给碳酸钙后几无差别。其30%硫酸水解产物，含有：白氨酸、蛋氨酸、丙氨酸、甘氨酸、谷氨酸、天门冬氨酸等氨基酸，对兔的耳壳血管及血压无作用，但能增大离体蟾蜍心跳振幅，降低离体兔肠张力，对兔有短暂的利尿作用。珍珠层4N盐酸提取液能抑制组织胺对离体豚鼠小肠的收缩作用。其乙醚提取液能抑制组织胺对肠管的收缩，防止组织胺引起豚鼠的休克及死亡；对马血清致敏的豚鼠过敏性休克虽不能防止，但对脏器过敏，如对豚鼠离体肠管、子宫的收缩，则有抑制的倾向。珍珠贝壳粉对小鼠肉瘤-180有抑制作用。珍珠层30%硫酸水解产物，可使蟾蜍离体心脏跳动幅度加大，使兔离体肠管紧张性降低，对兔并有短暂的利尿作用。酸水解物的乙醚提取液（除去钙），有对抗组胺引起的肠管收缩作用，并能保护豚鼠因组胺引起的休克，此外尚有升压作用。马氏珍珠贝珍珠层、珍珠水解液，全脏器（含肉）、精卵液提取液中的牛磺酸，0.5ml/只腹腔注射，用剪尾法测定出血，能缩短小鼠出血时间，且较催产素缩短51.4%；0.75ml/kg静注，明显增强兔在体子宫的收缩作用，持续时间在30分钟以上，比脑垂体后叶素持续时间长；94.1ml/kg腹腔注射，明显抑制小鼠自发活动。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-annxpuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-annxpuq","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】大鼠灌胃珍珠层粉的半数致死量＞21.5g/kg，经皮给药的半数致死量＞31.6g/kg。以珍珠层粉均匀混于饲料中，连续喂养刚断奶后的大鼠2月，478ppm剂量组和1，434ppm组给药2月后，均未见到体重增长有所影响（P＞0.05），但在4，300ppm组，对体重增长则有影响，雄性大鼠在给药第7天和第8周，体重均数较对照组明显降低（P\u003c0.01），除此以外，雄鼠在6周内和雌鼠在8周内的体重均数虽有不同程度的下降，但统计学处理无显着差别。剂量为4，300ppm组的大鼠血红蛋白降低，血清尿素氮升高，病理学检查未见异常，但对体重增长有影响。按中国通用的急性毒性分级标准，大鼠口服半数致死量＞5，000mg/kg，属于实际无毒，为此珍珠母应属于低毒性药物。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-47its7b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-47its7b","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-565nxfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-565nxfi","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.珍珠母，取原药材，除去杂质及灰屑，打碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-8wwnfso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-8wwnfso","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.煅珍珠母，取净珍珠母置适宜容器内，用武火加热，煅至酥脆，取出放凉，打碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-s80abha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-s80abha","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.珍珠层粉，取净珍珠母用砂轮磨去外、中层，保留内层（珍珠层），浸入50×的高锰酸钾中消毒30min，再用清水洗净，粉碎，过130目筛，水飞，烘干，再粉碎，过200目行筛后干燥即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-oexvlre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-oexvlre","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味甘；咸；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-gv5c93t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-gv5c93t","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；心经"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-6t5enrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-6t5enrr","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】平肝潜阳；安神定惊；清肝明目。主头痛眩晕；心悸失眠；癫狂惊痫；肝热目赤；翳膜遮睛"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-zxp181h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-zxp181h","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，10-30g，打碎先煎；右研末，每次1.5-3g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-lti9h9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-lti9h9m","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】脾胃虚寒者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-9xf2zvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-9xf2zvr","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】①治肝阳上升，头晕头痛，眼花耳鸣，面颊燥热：珍珠母五钱至一两，制女贞、旱莲草各三钱。水煎服。(《常用中草药图谱》)②治心悸失眠：珍珠母五钱至一两，远志一钱，酸枣仁三钱，炙甘草一钱五分。水煎服。(《常用中草药图谱》)③治内眼疾患(晶体混浊，视神经萎缩)：珍珠母二两，苍术八钱，人参一钱。水煎，日服二次。(《吉林中草药》)"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-4nbjba0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-4nbjba0","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-gzwewbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-gzwewbq","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《中国医学大辞典》：滋肝阴，清肝火。治癫狂惊痫，头眩，耳鸣，心跳，胸腹膜胀，妇女血热，血崩，小儿惊搐发痉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-sb3hbcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-sb3hbcz","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《饮片新参》：平肝潜阳，安神魂，定惊痫，消热痞、眼翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-al5io6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-al5io6y","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《吉林中草药》：止血。治吐血，衄血，崩漏。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-2ajhku0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-2ajhku0","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4．《中国医学大辞典》：此物(珍珠母)兼入心、肝两经，与石决明但入肝经者不同，故涉神志病者，非此不可。"}]},{"ID":"20240902105252-n6a2vxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105252-n6a2vxj","updated":"20240902105253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902105253-55x9mm1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902105253-55x9mm1"}},{"ID":"20240902105254-jyydbm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105254-jyydbm9"}}]}